  "roleRuleText": "{roleId, select, voleur{Wake the Thief. He may swap his card with one of the two undealt cards, or keep his own.} cupidon{Wake Cupid. He picks two players who fall in love, then the two lovers open their eyes to recognise each other before going back to sleep.} voyante{Wake the Seer. She points at a player, whose role you reveal to her.} loup_garou{Wake the Werewolves. Together they choose their victim.} sorciere{Wake the Witch. Show her the wolves' victim. She may use her life potion and/or her death potion.} villageois{No night action.} petite_fille{No call: she may peek during the Werewolves' turn, at her own risk.} chasseur{No night action: when he dies (day or night), he immediately eliminates a player of his choice.} renard{Wake the Fox (optional). He points at a player: you tell him whether a Werewolf is among that player and their two living neighbours. If there is none, he loses his power for good.} deux_soeurs{Wake the Two Sisters: they recognise each other, then go back to sleep. Optional after night 1, every other night.} montreur_d_ours{Wake the Bear Tamer on night 1 to know who he is. Every morning, after the victims, you growl if one of his two living neighbours is a Werewolf.} other{}}",
  "roleMjTips": "{roleId, select, cupidon{Note who the lovers are: if one dies, the other dies too.} sorciere{Each potion can only be used once per game.} other{}}",
